@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Dynamic imports with ?raw, ?url and ?worker produce a glob with the query string and import '*', and other queries are kept as a query string (packages/vite/src/node/__tests__/plugins/dynamicImportVar/__snapshots__/parse.spec.ts.snap) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 The dev worker script is requested as ?worker_file&type=module and keeps its sourcemap boundary (playground/worker/__tests__/iife/iife-worker.spec.ts) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Query checks
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Match worker, sharedworker, worker_file, inline and url queries with regexes in the worker plugins (packages/vite/src/node/plugins/worker.ts, packages/vite/src/node/plugins/workerImportMetaUrl.ts)
+- [ ] 2.2 Split the query string once in the dynamic import vars plugin and match raw, url and worker with regexes (packages/vite/src/node/plugins/dynamicImportVars.ts)
+- [ ] 2.3 Read the html proxy index with a regex in the css-post plugin (packages/vite/src/node/plugins/css.ts)
+- [ ] 2.4 Remove parseRequest (packages/vite/src/node/utils.ts)
